{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A horror story that could happen to anyone.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strangers who might show up at your door.<br>Choices you\u2019ll have to make.<br>A truth that\u2019s hard to accept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short psychological visual novel is more about perception than traditional storytelling. Every choice determines how the final outcome unfolds. Every detail is intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/d18cd89a6f0cd234a8996bc6411cfc12.avif?t=1764953007\" width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Story</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young couple moves into a new apartment after their wedding - but the husband leaves on a business trip right away, leaving his wife alone. Not the best honeymoon, to say the least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not the only problem that has fallen on their shoulders - a strange woman has started to visit the apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness, confusion, and anxiety\u2014this is how the story begins. Your decisions will shape its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But some things are beyond your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/b724b40cd6062671eb2ada3c80b986d9.avif?t=1764953007\" width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings for the main storyline and 2 for the side plot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that define you \u2014 and decide your ending;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, atmospheric visual style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough takes 20-35 minutes, but it may take more than one playthrough to understand the story fully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515690?t=1764953007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515690?t=1764953007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/5ecd643e253d34725f240d75fd784c8cf2a2f3a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764953007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/5ecd643e253d34725f240d75fd784c8cf2a2f3a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764953007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence: the character engages in aggressive actions, resulting in injury with visible bleeding."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A horror story that could happen to anyone.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strangers who might show up at your door.<br>Choices you\u2019ll have to make.<br>A truth that\u2019s hard to accept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short psychological visual novel is more about perception than traditional storytelling. Every choice determines how the final outcome unfolds. Every detail is intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/d18cd89a6f0cd234a8996bc6411cfc12.avif?t=1764953007\" width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Story</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young couple moves into a new apartment after their wedding - but the husband leaves on a business trip right away, leaving his wife alone. Not the best honeymoon, to say the least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not the only problem that has fallen on their shoulders - a strange woman has started to visit the apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness, confusion, and anxiety\u2014this is how the story begins. Your decisions will shape its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But some things are beyond your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/b724b40cd6062671eb2ada3c80b986d9.avif?t=1764953007\" width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings for the main storyline and 2 for the side plot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that define you \u2014 and decide your ending;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, atmospheric visual style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough takes 20-35 minutes, but it may take more than one playthrough to understand the story fully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Right Hand Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/5b25c3bf7e632862ff0f33b1b0defa0754a5edba/header.jpg?t=1764953007","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul